## Bước 2: Kế hoạch tài nguyên tái sử dụng (Skill Creator Step 2)

### Phân loại giải pháp theo Skill Creator framework

| Solution | Type | Freedom | Rationale |
|----------|------|---------|-----------|
| U1: Pre-flight retry | **Script** (`scripts/`) | Low | Fragile operation → cần deterministic retry |
| U2: Path normalize | **Convention** (update workflow text) | Medium | Nhiều approach valid nhưng cần consistency |
| U3: Score enforcement | **Script update** | Low | Must-pass gate → zero flexibility |
| U4: Auto pitch deck | **Workflow text** update | Medium | Optional → mandatory, nhưng có fallback |
| U5: UXP registry | **Reference** (`references/`) | Medium | Reusable knowledge, agent-driven matching |
| U6: Checkpoint-resume | **Script** + convention | Low | Fragile (context limit) → deterministic save |
| U7: Gate cross-validation | **Script update** | Low | Deterministic check = script territory |

### Decisions theo "Cách làm việc" (Simplify Agent)

| Item | "Xây tool" hay "Agent + input"? | Decision |
|------|------|------|
| U1 Pre-flight | Script — batch checks, exit code needed | ✅ Script `preflight-check.sh` |
| U2 Path normalize | Convention — agent thay đổi hành vi based on text | ✅ Workflow text |
| U5 UXP registry | Reference — agent reads + cross-references | ✅ References file |
| U6 Checkpoint | Script — save/restore context deterministic | ✅ Script `checkpoint-save.js` |
| U7 Gate update | Script — existing scripts need enhancement | ✅ Script update |

