## Bước 3-4: Implementation Plan (6 work items)

### WI-1: Pre-flight Consolidation + Retry 🔧

**Problem:** 12 checks chạy tuần tự, 1 fail → pipeline dừng. Không retry.

**Solution:** Gộp 12 checks thành 1 script `preflight-all.sh` chạy parallel.

**Implementation:**

```bash
# File: tools/scripts/preflight-all.sh
# Chạy tất cả 12 checks, retry 1 lần nếu fail, output JSON summary

# Parallel execution (background jobs)
check_figma_mcp &       # T-1
check_figma_token &     # T-2  
check_save_script &     # T-3
check_wrapper_script &  # T-4
check_gate_scripts &    # T-5
check_ddl_data &        # T-6, T-10, T-11, T-12
check_signal_registry & # T-7
check_score_tool &      # T-8
check_icon_tool &       # T-9

wait  # Wait all

# Retry failed checks once
for failed in "${FAILED[@]}"; do
  retry "$failed" || HARD_FAIL+=("$failed")
done

# Output: JSON + human-readable
echo '{"status":"PASS|FAIL","checks":[...],"retried":[]}'
```

**Changes:**
| File | Action |
|------|--------|
| `tools/scripts/preflight-all.sh` | **New** — consolidated pre-flight |
| [figma-to-ux-review.md](file:///Users/dataism/Documents/UXtool/.agents/workflows/figma-to-ux-review.md) § Bước 0 | **Update** — call `preflight-all.sh` instead of 12 individual checks |

**Effort:** Medium · **Priority:** P0 (fixes 2/7 stuck runs)

