### WI-2: Image Path Normalization Convention 📐

**Problem:** `wireframe_images[].filename` bare name vs full path — inconsistent.

**Solution:** Workflow rule: filename MUST be relative-to-output_dir.

**Implementation:**

```markdown
# Add to figma-to-ux-review.md § Phase 5 (Handoff)

### Image Path Convention (BẮT BUỘC)

`wireframe_images[].filename` = relative path từ `output_dir`:
  resolvable bằng: path.resolve(output_dir, filename)

| Structure | filename format |
|:---|:---|
| Flat `ui/` | `"ui/calendar.png"` |
| Multi `{section}/ui/` | `"section-name/ui/image.png"` |

❌ Anti-pattern: bare filename ("calendar.png") — ambiguous khi multi-folder
```

**Changes:**
| File | Action |
|------|--------|
| [figma-to-ux-review.md](file:///Users/dataism/Documents/UXtool/.agents/workflows/figma-to-ux-review.md) § Phase 5 | **Add** Image Path Convention section |
| [figma-to-ux-review.md](file:///Users/dataism/Documents/UXtool/.agents/workflows/figma-to-ux-review.md) § Anti-patterns | **Add** bare filename anti-pattern |

**Effort:** Low · **Priority:** P0 (prevents wrong image in Skill C + pitch deck)

