### WI-3: Gate Updates (multi-folder + cross-validation) 🔒

**Problem:** Gates check disk but don't cross-validate with [screen_inventory.json](file:///Users/dataism/Documents/UXtool/coopbank/final/Chuy%E1%BB%83n%20ti%E1%BB%81n%20ngo%C3%A0i%20Co-opBank/.handoff/screen_inventory.json).

**Solution:** Update gate scripts to validate `wireframe_images` paths resolve to real files.

**Implementation:**

```bash
# Update: tools/scripts/gate-vision-files.sh
# ADD: Cross-validate screen_inventory.json wireframe_images

INVENTORY="$PRD_FOLDER/.handoff/screen_inventory.json"
if [ -f "$INVENTORY" ]; then
  # Extract all wireframe_images filenames from inventory
  node -e "
    const inv = require('$INVENTORY');
    const screens = inv.screens || [];
    screens.forEach(s => {
      (s.wireframe_images || []).forEach(img => {
        const resolved = require('path').resolve('$PRD_FOLDER', img.filename);
        if (!require('fs').existsSync(resolved)) {
          console.error('❌ INVENTORY_MISMATCH: ' + img.filename + ' (screen: ' + s.id + ')');
          process.exitCode = 1;
        }
      });
    });
  "
fi
```

**Changes:**
| File | Action |
|------|--------|
| [tools/scripts/gate-vision-files.sh](file:///Users/dataism/Documents/UXtool/tools/scripts/gate-vision-files.sh) | **Update** — add inventory cross-check |
| [tools/scripts/gate-screenshot-check.sh](file:///Users/dataism/Documents/UXtool/tools/scripts/gate-screenshot-check.sh) | **Update** — add inventory cross-check |

**Effort:** Low · **Priority:** P1

---

### WI-4: Score Gate → Script Enforcement ⛔

**Problem:** Score verification là agent judgment (có thể skip). 1/7 runs thiếu score.

**Solution:** Đưa score check thành **script-enforced gate** thay vì agent instruction.

**Implementation:**

```bash
# File: tools/scripts/gate-score.sh
# Wraps ux-score-calculator.js as hard gate

REPORT="$1"
RESULT=$(node tools/ux-score-calculator.js run --json "$REPORT" 2>&1)
EXIT=$?

if [ $EXIT -eq 3 ]; then
  echo "⚠️ Discrepancies found. Auto-fixing..."
  node tools/ux-score-calculator.js run --fix "$REPORT"
  RESULT=$(node tools/ux-score-calculator.js run --json "$REPORT" 2>&1)
  EXIT=$?
fi

if [ $EXIT -ne 0 ]; then
  echo "❌ GATE-SCORE FAIL: Score verification failed after fix attempt"
  exit 1
fi

echo "✅ GATE-SCORE PASS"
echo "$RESULT"
exit 0
```

**Changes:**
| File | Action |
|------|--------|
| `tools/scripts/gate-score.sh` | **New** — script-enforced score gate |
| [figma-to-ux-review.md](file:///Users/dataism/Documents/UXtool/.agents/workflows/figma-to-ux-review.md) § Bước 5 | **Update** — call `gate-score.sh` |
| Gate Summary table | **Add** Score gate as T1 (script-enforced) |

**Effort:** Low · **Priority:** P0 (fixes score missing issue)

