| [.cursor/skills/ux-review-pipe/SKILL.md](file:///Users/dataism/Documents/UXtool/.cursor/skills/ux-review-pipe/SKILL.md) § Skill C | **Update** — add Layer C0 registry lookup |
| [figma-to-ux-review.md](file:///Users/dataism/Documents/UXtool/.agents/workflows/figma-to-ux-review.md) § Skill References | **Add** reference to uxp-registry |

**Effort:** Medium · **Priority:** P1 (reduces review redundancy, improves consistency)

